  =
  \begin{pmatrix}
    \pi_1^{-1}\Lambda_1 & 0                         & \cdots & 0 \\
    0                   & \pi_2^{-1}\Lambda_2       & \cdots & 0 \\
    \vdots              & \vdots                    & \ddots & \vdots \\
    0                   & 0                         & \cdots &
